01qSVQwRFM0eWs5VjlwVFdaYlJQdlh2UQ?oc=5","date":"2026-11-05","zh":"CVS Health 第三季財報電話會議重點在於計畫中的藥局分離"},{"title":"What CVS Health (CVS) Said on Its Q3 Earnings Call","src":"TradingView","url":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMirgFBVV95cUxPNXY3aVVUTE1PdVRTSGZZNkp6U3M2UG5vbjNaQ1h1VzNsdm02YU9uZkdVMHpKNFJ3Y2JlNnZBOGJ6M2NkSDE5OFJjLWpMdUdLQ2dwWmZKTDZmTGdadllJYUFKSHczdVdjZHRwSzNvaXd4ODBWQUt2YjlLMk5zZkhURVF1aWpIQWFnOFNVQ1R6eENtUkRSd3ZUdVF6T1l3Y0lLSUxGWlhXSnpCNDNhSnc?oc=5","date":"2026-11-05","zh":"CVS Health (CVS) 在第三季財報電話會議上的講話"},{"title":"Cardinal Health Q1 2027: EPS beats by 11%, CVS deal secured","src":"24/7 Wall St.","url":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMilgFBVV95cUxORDFkZ2xtY1l1QTVHZVg5MjNSVDFLdWJwcl9QWGpRdnpzWFdhMEgyV3BVYXN5UjdJQnN5cFR6d0pfbkV0b3dxd2FuUVR6TVFCVTFaY21hN2hBaVhaVlNwVW04VHR5X21YdklzQkhRX1l3YTlZM1o4bzN6U1ppcEpKNHV2elgxNDFSbGktYWhQLS1BVHZNa3c?oc=5","date":"2026-11-05","zh":"康德樂 2027 年第一季：每股收益成長 11%，CVS 交易達成"}],"themes":[{"name":"財報","count":7},{"name":"訂單/合約","count":1}],"biz":{"tenk":{"form":"10-K","date":"2026-02-10","period":"2025-12-31","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/64803/000006480326000010/cvs-20251231.htm"},"overview":[{"en":"CVS Health Corporation, together with its subsidiaries (collectively, \"CVS Health,\" the \"Company,\" \"we,\" \"our\" or \"us\"), is a leading health solutions company building a world of health around every consumer it serves and connecting care so that it works for people wherever they are. As of December 31, 2025, we had approximately 9,000 retail locations, more than 1,000 walk-in and primary care medical clinics and a leading pharmacy benefits manager with approximately 87 million plan members and expanding specialty pharmacy solutions. We serve an estimated more than 37 million people through traditional, voluntary and consumer-directed health insurance products and related services, including expanding Medicare Advantage offerings and a leading standalone Medicare Part D prescription drug plan (\"PDP\"). We are creating new sources of value through our integrated model allowing us to expand ","zh":"CVS Health Corporation 及其子公司（統稱「CVS Health」、「本公司」、「我們」、「我們的」或「我們的」）是一家領先的健康解決方案公司，圍繞其服務的每位消費者建立一個健康世界，並連接護理，使其為無論身在何處的人們提供服務。截至 2025 年 12 月 31 日，我們擁有約 9,000 個零售網點、超過 1,000 個步入式和初級保健醫療診所以及一家領先的藥房福利管理公司，擁有約 8700 萬計劃會員和不斷擴展的專業藥房解決方案。我們透過傳統、自願和消費者導向的健康保險產品及相關服務，包括擴大 Medicare Advantage 產品和領先的獨立 Medicare D 部分處方藥計劃（“PDP”），為估計超過 3700 萬人提供服務。我們正在透過我們的整合模型創造新的價值來源，使我們能夠擴展"},{"en":"Our ambition at CVS Health is to be America's most trusted health care company. Our purpose is to simplify health care one person, one family and one community at a time. Across our unique collection of businesses, our work is rooted in our values: we care, we innovate with purpose, we are accountable and we prioritize safety and quality. Our strategy is focused on simplifying health care experiences, improving engagement, lowering costs and delivering better health outcomes. We expect to create sustainable shareholder value by delivering best-in-class execution, transforming consumer experiences, being the partner of choice and harnessing enterprise capabilities, enabled by innovation and capital stewardship.","zh":"CVS Health 的目標是成為美國最值得信賴的醫療保健公司。我們的目標是一次簡化一個人、一個家庭和一個社區的醫療保健。在我們獨特的業務組合中，我們的工作植根於我們的價值觀：我們關心、我們有目的地創新、我們負責、我們優先考慮安全和品質。我們的策略重點是簡化醫療保健體驗、提高參與度、降低成本並提供更好的健康結果。我們期望透過提供一流的執行力、轉變消費者體驗、成為首選合作夥伴並利用創新和資本管理的企業能力來創造可持續的股東價值。"},{"en":"The Health Care Benefits segment operates as one of the nation's leading diversified health care benefits providers through its Aetna operations, serving an estimated more than 37 million people as of December 31, 2025. The Health Care Benefits segment has the information and resources to help members, in consultation with their health care professionals, make more informed decisions about their health care. The Health Care Benefits segment offers a broad range of traditional, voluntary and consumer-directed health insurance products and related services, including medical, pharmacy, dental and behavioral health plans, medical management capabilities, Medicare Advantage and Medicare Supplement plans, PDPs and Medicaid health care management services. The Health Care Benefits segment's primary customers, its members, primarily access the segment's products and services through employer gr","zh":"醫療保健福利部門透過其 Aetna 業務，成為全國領先的多元化醫療保健福利提供者之一，截至 2025 年 12 月 31 日，估計為超過 3700 萬人提供服務。醫療保健福利部門擁有資訊和資源，可協助會員與醫療保健專業人員協商，就其醫療保健做出更明智的決定。醫療保健福利部門提供廣泛的傳統、自願和消費者導向的健康保險產品及相關服務，包括醫療、藥房、牙科和行為健康計劃、醫療管理能力、醫療保險優勢和醫療保險補充計劃、PDP 和醫療補助醫療保健管理服務。醫療保健福利部門的主要客戶（即其成員）主要透過雇主組織來取得該部門的產品和服務。"}],"markets":[],"customers":[{"en":"The U.S. federal government is a significant customer of the Health Care Benefits segment through contracts with CMS for coverage of Medicare-eligible individuals and federal employee-related benefit programs. Other than the contracts with CMS, the Health Care Benefits segment is not dependent upon a single customer or a few customers the loss of which would have a significant effect on the earnings of the segment. The loss of business from any one or a few independent brokers or agents would not have a material adverse effect on the earnings of the Health Care Benefits segment. Health Care Benefits segment revenues from the federal government accounted for approximately 20% of the Company's consolidated total revenues in 2025, 2024 and 2023. Contracts with CMS for coverage of Medicare-eligible individuals in the Health Care Benefits segment accounted for approximately 79%, 74% and 73%, ","zh":"美國聯邦政府是醫療保健福利部門的重要客戶，透過與 CMS 簽訂合同，涵蓋符合 Medicare 資格的個人和聯邦僱員相關福利計劃。除了與 CMS 簽訂的合約外，醫療保健福利部門不依賴單一客戶或少數客戶，這些客戶的損失將對該部門的利潤產生重大影響。任何一個或幾個獨立經紀人或代理人的業務損失不會對醫療保健福利部門的收益產生重大不利影響。來自聯邦政府的醫療保健福利部門收入約占公司 2025 年、2024 年和 2023 年合併總收入的 20%。與 CMS 簽訂的覆蓋醫療保健福利部門符合 Medicare 資格的個人的合約約佔 79%、74% 和 73%，"}],"competition":[],"segments":{"seg":{"end":"2025-12-31","items":[{"name":"Health Services","val":190425000000,"zh":"健康服務部門"},{"name":"Health Care Benefits","val":143354000000,"zh":"醫療保健福利部門"},{"name":"Pharmacy & Consumer Health","val":139367000000,"zh":"藥房和消費者健康部門"}],"total":402067000000},"prod":{"end":"2025-12-31","items":[{"name":"Product","val":249908000000,"zh":"產品"},{"name":"Service","val":15175000000,"zh":"服務"}],"total":402067000000}},"peers":["TGT","BMY","ABBV","UNH","ABT"]}}